Manual de Saneamento — Funasa, fifth edition (@wu-funasa: 0, is #reference, #part-of @wu-sources) { r_65G5YY3QVCA8HAXMPC8RTPKEWE
Fundação Nacional de Saúde. Manual de Saneamento, 5th edition, Brasília, 2019. Portuguese. [Official publication and download](https://www.gov.br/funasa/pt-br/centrais-de-conteudo/publicacoes/engenharia-de-saude-publica/manual-de-saneamento) · [ANA library catalogue](https://biblioteca.ana.gov.br/sophia_web/Acervo/Detalhe/91837).

Read chapters 1–5 together for health, environment, water supply, sewerage and drainage. Later work chapters 9–12 for geographical information, unusual service settings, construction and environmental-health education. The remaining chapters connect solid wastes and vector control with the wider sanitation setting. Use the whole manual as a substantial Portuguese introduction, then deepen the relevant engineering methods in the specialist books.

The catalogue identifies the 2019 fifth edition; the publication webpage's later upload and modification dates are not a new edition. The official site provides authorized access. Retain the actual work's copyright and component notices; no general adaptation licence is inferred from government hosting. Technical and legal references reflect the edition's date and must be checked against current requirements.

